# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: PRP All India City Popup & GVS popup (test case 1325, run 115613, last result SUCCESS)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

call PS_Touch_Location_Popup
open https://www.justdial.com/india/Brick?ismap=&srcterm=Brick
wait for page to load
delete all cookies
refresh page
call PS_consent_popup
scroll to prp_bd7_banner_section
verify element prp_bd7_banner_section is visible
swipe bottom to top until element b2b_prp_gvs_popup is visible, closing b2b_prp_all_india_location_pop_cross, max 10 times, wait 0.5
run javascript "document.querySelector('[class*="skipbtn"]').click();"
